<title>NORWAY: NYCOMED H1 OPERATING PROFIT PER DIVISION.</title>
<headline>NYCOMED H1 OPERATING PROFIT PER DIVISION.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operating profit per division at Norwegian pharmaceuticals company Nycomed ASA for the six months to June 30.</p>
<p>				   (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>  Nycomed Imaging			833	vs	1,012</p>
<p>  Nycomed Pharma			 324	vs	  253</p>
<p>  Research &amp; Development costs     389	vs	  450</p>
<p>  Unallocated/eliminations    minus 44	vs  minus  43</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
